      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehosofaati akatuuza, yatabaazibwa hamu na baisenkuru, omu rubuga rwa Daudi; omutabani Yehoraamu yateera engoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukama Yehoraamu owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoraamu akaba aina abatabani ba Yehosofaati, nubo banu: Azaliya, Yehyeri, Zekaliya, Azaliya, Mikairi na Sefatiya; abo boona, bakaba bali batabani ba Yehosafaati omukama wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isebo akabaha ebisembo bingi, efeeza ezaabbu, n'ebintu eby'omuhendo, oteho n'embuga ezizitiriirwe ez'omunsi ya Yuda; baitu obukama, akabuha Yehoraamu, habwokuba nuwe akaba ali muzigaijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoraamu obu yamazire kuteera engoma ya ise yasigika, abanyina boona yabaisa empirima, n'abamu ha banyoro ba Isirairi, nukwo yabagira ati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoraamu kuteera engoma, akaba ahikize emyaka asatu n'ebiri, akalemera emyaka munaana, ali omu rubuga Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakora nk'abakama ba Isirairi, nk'enju y'Ahabbu nkooku ekaba ekozire; habwokuba omu ha bahara b'Ahabbu, nuwe yaswiire. Akakora ebinyakubiihiza MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 11:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu MUKAMA atagonze kuhwerekereza enju ya Daudi, habwokuba akaba akozire na uwe endagaano; kandi akaba amunihiize ngu baijukuru be balirema ebiro byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.27.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 27:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu businge bwe, Edomu nubwo yayemere yarugaho Yuda bwaba bukama oburukwetwara bwonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoraamu nubwo yaimukire ekiro, yagenda hamu n'engabwa ze n'ebigaali bye, yateera Ab'Edomu, abakaba bamugosire, hamu n'engabwa ez'ebigaali bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edomu nukwo yayebaganiizeho Yuda eti, yaikara yonka okuhika na hati. Omu kasumi ako, Libuna nayo ekeebaganizaaho Yehoraamu, habwokuba, akaba arugireho MUKAMA, Ruhanga owa baisenkuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atakole eki kyonka, akataho ebiikaro eby'Abanyamahanga, eby'okuramizaamu omunsi ey'ensozi eya Yuda. Abasi ba Yerusaalemu yabafoora bantu abatali beesige, kandi yahabisa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eriya omurangi akamutwekera ebbaruha erukugamba eti, “MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Sso Daudi, naagamba ati, ‘Habwokuba otakole nka Sso Yehosafaati, rundi nk'Asa omukama wa Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu wakora nk'abakama ba Isirairi oku baakozire, Yuda n'abasi ba Yerusaalemu yabacwamu obwesige, eka y'Ahabbu nkooku yabucwiremu Isirairi, kandi waita abaanyoko ab'enju ya Sso, abakaba nibakukira oburungi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naija kuleetera abantu bawe kagingo etagambwa, agireetere abaana bawe, bakazi bawe n'ebintu byawe byona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi na iwe wenka, olirwara endwara ey'amaani, endwara ey'amara eraakweyongeraga buli kiro okuhika amara obu galikakuruga omunda.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti n'Abaharabu abakaba baheriire Abanyesopiya MUKAMA akabaleetera kukwatirwa Yehoraamu ekiniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kuseesira Yuda baagihamba baatwara ebintu byona ebi bakasangire, ebikaba biri omu Kaaruziika baahamba na batabani be na bakazi be hatabeho mwana n'omu ou baamusigiireho, okwihaho Yehoyahazi macura ge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi byona obu byamazire kubaho, MUKAMA yamuleetera omu mara endwara etakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma obu haahingwireho emyaka ebiri, yafa omu busaasi obutabonwa. Abantu be, batahembe murro kumutamu ekitiinisa, nk'ogu baahembiire baisenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutandika kulema akaba ahikize emyaka asatu n'ebiri, akalemera emyaka munaana, ali omu rubuga Yerusaalemu, yafa, hataroho muntu n'omu arukumusaalirirwa. Baamuziika omu rubuga rwa Daudi, baitu batamuziike omu magasani g'abakama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
